# CODEOWNERS for the Role Profile registry.
# Organisation: eiraman. Teams are created with the organisation.
#
# Rule (GOVERNANCE.md §4.5 and WORKING-GROUPS.md §3 in the community repository): a family is published by the reviewers of its publishing
# domain, never by the family group or the author. Each folder therefore lists only the domain team.
# Family maintainer teams (@eiraman/wg-<family>) review content first, but their approval does not
# satisfy the required code-owner review. A domain team with no members blocks merges in its folders:
# that is the technical form of "a domain without a reviewer cannot publish profiles".
# Last matching pattern wins: defaults first, families next, per-profile overrides last.
#
# Domain teams (GOVERNANCE.md §4.5): cloud-architecture, security, app-data-architecture, test-quality,
# privacy, legal-compliance. Cross-cutting: devsecops-tooling, steward.

